---
import PageLayout from "@/layouts/Base.astro";

const meta = {
	description:
		"Learn about Linshad, a full-stack developer focused on building modern web applications and exploring software engineering.",
	title: "About",
};
---

<PageLayout meta={meta}>
	<h1 class="title mb-12">About</h1>

	<div class="prose prose-sm prose-cactus max-w-none">
		<p>
			I'm Linshad, a developer focused on building modern, scalable web applications. My interests
			lie in full-stack development, problem-solving, and understanding how software works across
			the entire stack — from intuitive user interfaces to reliable backend systems.
		</p>
		<p>
			My development journey has been driven by continuous learning and hands-on experimentation.
			Through structured learning and practical projects, I've been developing a strong foundation
			in web technologies, software architecture, database management, and application development.
		</p>
		<p>My technical experience and current areas of focus include:</p>
		<ul class="list-inside list-disc" role="list">
			<li>Frontend development with HTML, CSS, JavaScript, Tailwind CSS and React</li>
			<li>Backend development with Node.js, Express.js and RESTful APIs</li>
			<li>Database design and management with MongoDB and MySQL</li>
			<li>TypeScript, object-oriented programming and software design principles</li>
			<li>Authentication, third-party integrations and payment workflows</li>
			<li>Application deployment, server configuration and production environments</li>
		</ul>

		<p>
			I enjoy turning ideas into functional products and working through the challenges involved in
			building complete applications. One example is
			<a
				class="cactus-link inline-block"
				href="https://granthae.linshad.xyz/"
				rel="noreferrer"
				target="_blank"
			>
				GRANTHAE
			</a>
			, a peer-to-peer book rental and marketplace platform that I designed and developed. It gave
			me practical experience working across frontend, backend, database, and payment integration
			workflows.
		</p>
		<p>
			I'm continuously improving my skills, exploring new technologies, and building projects that
			strengthen my understanding of software engineering. You can explore my code and projects on
			<a
				class="cactus-link inline-block"
				href="https://github.com/linshadj"
				rel="noreferrer"
				target="_blank"
			>
				GitHub
			</a>
			.
		</p>

		<h2>Resume</h2>

		<p>
			Want to know more about my technical background, skills, and experience? You can view or
			download my resume below.
		</p>

		<p>
			<a class="cactus-link inline-block" href="/resume.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">
				View Resume ↗
			</a>
			<span class="mx-2">|</span>
			<a class="cactus-link inline-block" href="/resume.pdf" download="Linshad-Resume.pdf">
				Download Resume ↓
			</a>
		</p>
	</div>
</PageLayout>
